# VS Code, in the root and in every project's folder: share the settings, keep everything else in
# .vscode local, and keep the shared files and the workspace even where a global rule ignores them
!**/.vscode/
**/.vscode/*
!**/.vscode/settings.json
!**/.vscode/tasks.json
!**/.vscode/launch.json
!**/.vscode/extensions.json
!**/.vscode/*.code-snippets
!*.code-workspace
